product_authority:
  stage: early alpha; no working release has ever been achieved
  generation_rule: TinyRustLM is one product; SLM2 and related numeric labels are format identities, not product generations.
  clean_slate: No legacy readers, compatibility, migrations, aliases, dual contracts, hidden retry, repair, best-of-N, fallback, knowingly temporary architecture, or accepted debt.
  quality_rule: A rewrite is authorized when it yields the best current design; delete the superseded path after all callers, tests, and docs move together.

