source_control_and_release:
  - Commit and push after each coherent green major change.
  - Fetch and verify local HEAD, tracking and direct remote branch identity. FETCH_HEAD is not authority.
  - Deploy every affected site whenever all of its tests, docs, security, privacy, authorization, rollback, and readback gates pass.
  - Never deploy uncommitted source or let marketing, docs, version, release date, publication log, and behavior drift.

