working_product_review:
  date: 2026-09-19
  owner_status: Early alpha, no working release ever achieved; a fully working release requires official owner acceptance. No debt, obsolete code or legacy support before acceptance.
  intake: Sixteen research reports reviewed and applied by topic; report_decision_index owns dispositions and corrections.
  current_memory_scope: All current root .uai files, this workspace and the ecosystem routing UAI; dated relocation/storage receipts remain immutable history.
  first_product_path: Exact eligible source usefulness -> semantic/numerical correctness -> measured real browser quality/resources -> qualified catalog/seed -> verified installation -> useful beginner conversation -> official acceptance.
  independent_work: Candidate admission, development rubrics, first-run state design and read-only hosting discovery may proceed independently; existing material/release gates remain.
  proposals_only: Format/backend replacement, training recipe/distribution changes, GPU/cloud provisioning and new transport layouts require evidence and coherent implementation decisions.
  publication_wip: C31 canonical-input publication refactor is locally tested; source copies are removed from its active path, but remote capability admission remains blocked and no live deployment result follows.
  memory_review_limit: No fresh public site audit, model execution, qualification, live MemoryEndpoints operation, blocked deletion or release acceptance is claimed.
  historical_rules: Source relocation and storage-consolidation UAI describe their dated observations only; do not use them to claim today's source scan is complete.
